    <title>Car Fix</title>
    <desc>The hosts repair and modify all types of cars and also suggest easy ways to fix car-related problems.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831190000 +0530" stop="20260831195500 +0530" channel="541">
    <title>Street Outlaws</title>
    <desc>Street racing in the US is the subject of this docu-reality series, which purportedly provides an inside look into the action both on the road and behind the scenes. In Oklahoma City, for example, racers boast having the fastest street cars in the country, and the racing, they say, comes first - before family, before friends and before work. From a 1969 Chevy Nova to a race-ready farm truck, the vehicles - and their drivers - come in all shapes and sizes and have one thing in common: the need for speed.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
