  <programme start="20260904155700 +0530" stop="20260904162300 +0530" channel="568">
    <title>The Mind Control Freaks</title>
    <desc>Mind control is a phenomenon that not everyone necessarily believes in, but this programme may make more people think it&apos;s real with some of the mind manipulations that are featured. The show features master manipulators, including professional poker player Liv Boeree and mentalism expert Lewis Le Val, who use their abilities to influence others&apos; actions. The results of some of their experiments include a man forgetting his fiancee, strangers giving away their car keys, and a boxer becoming unable to crush a foam cup.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
